# README.md template
# Spring MCP Code Intelligence Server

[![CI Pipeline](https://github.com/yourusername/spring-mcp-code-intelligence/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/yourusername/spring-mcp-code-intelligence/actions/workflows/ci.yml)
[![Coverage](https://codecov.io/gh/yourusername/spring-mcp-code-intelligence/branch/main/graph/badge.svg)](https://codecov.io/gh/yourusername/spring-mcp-code-intelligence)
[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg)](https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT)

A sophisticated Model Context Protocol (MCP) server built with Spring Boot that analyzes codebases and provides intelligent context to AI models.

## 🚀 Quick Start

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/spring-mcp-code-intelligence.git
cd spring-mcp-code-intelligence

# Start with Docker Compose
docker-compose up -d

# Or run locally
./mvnw spring-boot:run
```

## 📋 Prerequisites

- Java 21+
- Docker & Docker Compose
- PostgreSQL 15+
- Redis 7+

## 🏗️ Architecture

This project demonstrates:
- **Spring Boot 3.2+** with reactive programming (WebFlux)
- **Model Context Protocol** implementation
- **Code analysis** and intelligence features
- **GitHub integration** for repository analysis
- **Vector search** for semantic code search
- **Production-ready** observability and monitoring

## 🔧 Configuration

Set environment variables:

```bash
export GITHUB_TOKEN=your_github_token
export DATABASE_URL=jdbc:postgresql://localhost:5432/springmcp
export REDIS_HOST=localhost
```

## 📖 API Documentation

Once running, visit:
- API Docs: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html
- Health Check: http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
- Metrics: http://localhost:8080/actuator/metrics

## 🧪 Testing

```bash
# Unit tests
./mvnw test

# Integration tests
./mvnw failsafe:integration-test

# All tests with coverage
./mvnw clean verify
```
